<title>USA: Fonar says receives $128.7 mln from GE.</title>
<headline>Fonar says receives $128.7 mln from GE.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonar Corp said Wednesday it had received $128.7 million from General Electric Co, representing a judgment plus interest against GE in a patent infringement case.</p>
<p>A federal jury awarded Fonar $103 million in 1995. The jury found GE had violated two Fonar patents, including a cancer detection patent.</p>
<p>In May, the U.S. Supreme Court denied GE's motion to stay payment of the award pending appeal to the court.</p>
<p>Fonar said payment of the judgment does not preclude GE appealing to the Supreme Court, GE's only remaining recourse.</p>
<p>Fonar initiated the suit in 1992.</p>
</text>
